    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../handler/HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.handler\"><code>HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy</code></a> for <code>RequestMappingInfo</code>-based handler\nmethod mappings.\n\nIf the <code>RequestMappingInfo</code> name attribute is set, its value is used.\nOtherwise the name is based on the capital letters of the class name,\nfollowed by \"#\" as a separator, and the method name. For example \"TC#getFoo\"\nfor a class named TestController with method getFoo.",
      "translation": "用于基于 `RequestMappingInfo` 的处理器方法映射的<a href=\"../../handler/HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.handler\"><code>HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy</code></a>。\n\n如果设置了 `RequestMappingInfo` 的名称属性，则使用其值；否则，名称基于类名的大写字母，后跟 \"#\" 作为分隔符，以及方法名。例如，对于名为 TestController 的类和方法 getFoo，名称为 \"TC#getFoo\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../handler/HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy.html#getName(org.springframework.web.method.HandlerMethod,T)\">HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../handler/HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy.html#getName(org.springframework.web.method.HandlerMethod,T)\">HandlerMethodMappingNamingStrategy</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Separator between the type and method-level parts of a HandlerMethod mapping name.",
      "translation": "HandlerMethod 映射名称中类型部分与方法级别部分之间的分隔符。",
      "count": 2
